{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up at <strong>The Gateway, c</strong>onfront the mirrors, and close the <strong>6 eyes</strong> of the demons keeping you imprisoned! This is a <strong>fast paced rouge-like shooter</strong>, with a combat system that forces every bullet and move to matter.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, shooting is based on a turn timer which you can influence. Every time you dash, or kill enemies the turn timer will move faster. Playing fast and reckless will allow you too attack very fast, <i>but careful not to be  too reckless!<strong>\u00a0</strong></i>Missing bullets will slow down your timer.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to face a demon, you will need to clear 3 <strong>randomly generated</strong> islands. Which are guarded by monsters.\u00a0Survive islands with the help of <strong>perks</strong> and <strong>upgrades.</strong> These will help you become more and more powerful the further you get. With\u00a0<strong>infinitely</strong>\u00a0stacking perks and your own skills, the monsters will have a hard time stopping you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863460?t=1753205800","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863460/4ccdb2a14ecf1c9a8d988ccbd0bc8a780c1fdb70/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753205800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps